creature TrafficLight
  traits
    color is text
  end traits

  when born
    give self the trait color to "Red"
  end born

  action change
    when self color == "Red"
      give self the trait color to "Green"
      say "The light turns Green."
    otherwise
      when self color == "Green"
        give self the trait color to "Yellow"
        say "The light turns Yellow."
      otherwise
        when self color == "Yellow"
          give self the trait color to "Red"
          say "The light turns Red."
        end when
      end when
    end when
  end action
end creature

creature Car
  traits
    name is text
  end traits

  when born with (name)
    give self the trait name to name
  end born

  action drive
    when self knows anyone as light
      give tl to self light
      when tl color == "Green"
        say self name + " drives through the intersection."
      otherwise
        say self name + " stops at the " + tl color + " light."
      end when
    end when
  end action
end creature

bring MainLight to life as TrafficLight
bring Sedan to life as Car with ("Sedan")

Sedan knows MainLight as light

Sedan does drive
MainLight does change
Sedan does drive
MainLight does change
Sedan does drive
MainLight does change
Sedan does drive
